    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🤖 Telegram AI Notebook Integration\n\nThis workflow automatically processes all incoming Telegram messages and intelligently adds them to your Notion \"Notebook\" database.\n\n### Supported Content Types:\n- 🔗 Links/URLs\n- 📝 Text messages\n- 🎤 Voice notes (auto-transcribed)\n- 📷 Images\n- 🎬 Videos\n- 📄 Documents\n- 🎵 Audio files\n\n### AI-Powered Features:\n- Smart title generation\n- Automatic categorization\n- Intelligent tagging\n- Task detection\n- Due date extraction\n- Description generation",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-300, 140]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ Setup Instructions\n\n1. **Telegram Bot**: Create bot via @BotFather and add API credentials\n2. **Notion**: Create integration and share \"Notebook\" database\n3. **OpenAI**: Add API key for GPT-4o and Whisper\n4. **Database ID**: Replace YOUR_NOTEBOOK_DATABASE_ID with your actual database ID\n\n### Required Notion Database Properties:\n- Name (Title)\n- URL (URL)\n- Category (Select)\n- Tags (Multi-select)\n- Description (Rich Text)\n- Created (Date)\n- Is Task (Checkbox)\n- Due Date (Date)\n- Priority (Select)\n- Content Type (Select)\n- Source (Rich Text)",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-note-setup",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
